File name: CAS4LOOP.MP
Path description: Dark-elf royal guards (minus the 6 regen room)
Path starts: Dark-elf castle level 4
Path ends: ---
Area of the game: Module 3
Level recommendation: 45+
Type of path: Loop
File format: New
Monsters encountered: dark-elf royal guard
Additional information:

To get to the start of this loop, you need an amber talisman (obtained
by killing the slaver leader on the slum rooftops), a bloodstone orb
(obtained from the gnome commander in black caves), a gate key
(obtained by killing the obsidian statue, outside the gates to the
dark-elf city) and a moldy key (obtained by killing Captain of the
Guard, trading the opal brooch he drops to the sleavy shopkeeper for a
glowing key, using that key to get to the dark-elf archmage, killing the
dark-elf archmage, taking the blue orb he drops and trading it to the
sleavy shopkeeper for a moldy key).
